Q ORI WRT /*
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-J2-SJ-FR1-SC2
POSS E 11.4 N -13.399999618530273 U 0
POSE E 11.4 N -13.399999618530273 U -190
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-J2-SJ-FR1-SC1
Q SPRE
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q BANG
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
Q CUTL
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-J2-SJ-FR1-SC2
Q SPRE
Q POSS
Q POSE
Q BANG
Q JOIS
Q JOIE
Q CUTL
/AIOS-SUITE-T2-J2-SJ-FR1-SC2-SN1
